This repository is Apache-2.0 except for the listed BSL modules. Each module's
license is authoritative; the per-file SPDX header and/or module-level LICENSE
file governs that module's terms.

Summary
-------

Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0): everything in this repository
except the modules listed below. Apache-2.0 is the default for any path not listed.

Business Source License 1.1 (full text in each module's own LICENSE file), these modules only:
