    aether/aether-deployment/
    aether/aether-control/
    aether/aether-ttm/
    aether/aether-ttm-onnx/
    aether/ember/
    aether/forge/forge-api/
    aether/forge/forge-core/
    aether/forge/forge-tests/
    aether/aether-stream/
    aether/aether-invoke/

The modules listed above are licensed under the Business Source License 1.1, with the parameters
below. This file is the repository-root LICENSE that the per-file header line "See LICENSE in the
repository root for full terms" refers to; each BSL module's own LICENSE file holds the full text.

The list is kept in tools/license/bsl-modules.txt; tools/check-licence-closure.py fails the build
if that file and this section disagree. aether/forge/forge-tests is a test harness outside the
default reactor; it depends on forge-core and is BSL for that reason.

